  "worked_solution": "The graph of $y=f(x)-2$ can be obtained from the graph of $y=f(x)$ by translating $2$ units *down*. \n\nSo, the graph $y=f(x)$ would be $2$ units *above* the graph of $y=f(x)-2.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14218283/assets/1f44fbd262f38470c13ae55acc11601491dde2662909e1a312600086a78b7adb.png)",
